  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252freggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_d4f4cb4f-4ed1-41d6-979c-4f4ed15ccaf8.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>感謝我們的贊助商</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感謝 ZAP-HOSTING！使用代碼 Reggarf-1047 可享全店 8 折優惠！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252freggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf</a><br><br><br><br></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>AE2：更好的村民</strong></span></h1>\n<h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">&nbsp; 現已同時支援 Forge/Neoforge 與 Fabric！</span></strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252freggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_8553830f-f787-4670-8839-419f79e3ee6b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></a><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">AE2：更好的村民</span> 為村莊增添了眾多 AE2 模組專屬<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">職業</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><br></span></strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>AE2：更好的村民</strong></span> 是一款以應用能源 2（AE2）機制為核心的模組，為遊戲引入了全新的村莊職業。本模組透過添加專門的村民來增強村莊互動，例如<strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">AE2 工程師</span></span></strong>、<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>AE2 工具匠</strong></span> 和 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>AE2 專家</strong></span>，他們會交易處理器、石英與儲存元件等關鍵物品。此模組提供了一種沉浸式的體驗，將 AE2 複雜的系統無縫融入遊戲的自然進程中，讓資源收集與合成變得更加有趣。</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">我們類似的專案<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_0861ee51-0976-4c91-9d17-97dbc4973b0f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"> <strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">CREATE：更好的村民</span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-villager</a></span></strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<blockquote>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>整合包開發者必讀</strong></span><br><br></h3>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>[檔案路徑] - config/ae_better_villagers-common.toml</p>\n<p>#注意：您可以根據需求修改文字與網址。</p>\n<p>[welcome_message]<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; # 啟用或停用歡迎訊息<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; enabled = true<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; # 玩家首次加入遊戲時顯示的訊息<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; text = \"感謝我們的贊助商！特別感謝 ZAP-Hosting！使用代碼 'Reggarf-1047' 可享訂單 8 折優惠！\"<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; # 玩家點擊連結時開啟的網址<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; url = \"<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252freggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf</a>\"</p>\n<p># 額外注意：請保留此設定以支持我。謝謝！。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br>功能列表</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">AE2 工具匠</span><br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center;color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">&nbsp;販售工具</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">工作台&nbsp; -&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">儲存單元工作台</span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_f28d1ad1-3931-4bf1-9d1a-6947daca656d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">AE2 工程師</span></span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center;color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">販售機器零件</span><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><br></span></span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">工作台&nbsp; -&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">控制器</span></span><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_72f667d8-5a59-4063-822d-754f38e575e5.png\" alt=\"\"></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">AE2 專家</span></span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center;color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">販售磁碟零件</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">工作台&nbsp; -&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">16K 合成儲存元件</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_d1753ac2-afec-4f7e-95d9-3d6695f3ee86.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>在 GitHub 或 Modrinth 上尋找 AE2：更好的村民</strong></h3>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252freggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_6835931a-2db5-42a1-8ebe-e7ee30bb025d.gif\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>",
